    "PLO4"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><strong data-end=\"2367\" data-start=\"2179\">Compare and contrast Mutex Locks and Semaphores in terms of usage, behavior, and implementation. Also, explain their role in solving synchronization problems with suitable examples.</strong></p>\n",
